GAL20V8
TEST20V8

A   B   C   D   E   F   G   H   NC  NC  NC  GND
NC  NC  AND NAN OR  NOR XOR MUX INV MAJ NC  VCC

AND   = A * B
/NAN  = A * B
OR    = A + B
/NOR  = A + B
XOR   = A * /B + /A * B
MUX   = E * /G + F * G
INV   = /H
MAJ   = A * B + A * C + B * C

DESCRIPTION
TOP2049 / toprammer GAL20V8 test design (combinational).
Pin 15 AND = A*B, 16 NAND, 17 OR = A+B, 18 NOR, 19 XOR = A^B,
20 MUX = G ? F : E, 21 INV = /H, 22 MAJ = majority(A,B,C).
Inputs: A..H = pins 1..8.
